  "escalated.ponder.walkways/customizing_walkways.text_4": "但走道上方必須有空間才行。",
  "escalated.ponder.walkways/customizing_walkways.text_5": "扶手同樣可以染色與清除染色。",
  "escalated.ponder.walkways/customizing_walkways.text_6": "最後，用玻璃右鍵點擊扶手可以把它變成玻璃扶手。",
